{
  "version": "Notebook/1.0",
  "items": [
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## Log4j - organization and environment overview\nStart with the organization overview, then investigate Azure, AWS, GCP, Hybrid/Arc, DevOps, or external/unclassified environments. All available reported findings are combined; there are no scanner or licensing tabs. **Scope is the signed-in tenant and selected subscriptions, not a guaranteed census of the entire organization.**\n\n**An empty result does not mean an environment is safe.** Missing connections, permissions, scanning, supported packages, exclusions, or fresh telemetry can all produce gaps. Foundational CSPM, paid Defender CSPM, and workload protection contribute different evidence; missing entitlement or risk metadata is unknown, not clean. ARG/workbook result limits apply; use paginated exports for exhaustive inventories.\n\n[Current recommendation schema](https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/defender-for-cloud/transition-grouped-individual-recommendations) | [Defender CSPM capabilities](https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/defender-for-cloud/concept-cloud-security-posture-management) | [Apache advisories](https://logging.apache.org/security.html) | Documentation reviewed 2026-10-29",
        "style": "info"
      },
      "name": "Headline"
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "206f87e8-2616-4d26-a94f-a97eb4cee619",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "Subscription",
            "type": 6,
            "description": "Subscriptions visible in the intended signed-in tenant. All ARG queries honor this scope; it also scopes the Azure anchors that store external connectors.",
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "includeAll": true,
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "defaultValue": "value::all"
          },
          {
            "id": "4b56f6c1-3f9e-4e15-8d66-55caf051b001",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "FindingScope",
            "label": "Log4j finding scope",
            "type": 2,
            "description": "Only the Log4j findings/summary use this filter. The broader posture, plan, connector, and inventory evidence remains visible.",
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": false,
            "jsonData": "[{\"value\":\"Log4Shell\",\"label\":\"2021 Log4j 2 CVEs\"},{\"value\":\"AllLog4j\",\"label\":\"All reported Log4j package CVEs\"}]",
            "value": "Log4Shell"
          },
          {
            "id": "4b56f6c1-3f9e-4e15-8d66-55caf051b005",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "Workload",
            "type": 2,
            "description": "Filters recommendation evidence and findings by workload, not by scanner or license. Subscription plan and connector discovery remain independently visible.",
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": false,
            "jsonData": "[{\"value\":\"All\",\"label\":\"All workloads\"},{\"value\":\"Machines\",\"label\":\"Machines\"},{\"value\":\"Containers\",\"label\":\"Containers / Kubernetes\"},{\"value\":\"Serverless\",\"label\":\"Apps / serverless\"},{\"value\":\"DevOps\",\"label\":\"Code repositories\"},{\"value\":\"Other\",\"label\":\"Other / unclassified workloads\"}]",
            "value": "All"
          },
          {
            "id": "4b56f6c1-3f9e-4e15-8d66-55caf051b002",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "Environment",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": true,
            "isHiddenWhenLocked": true,
            "value": "All"
          },
          {
            "id": "4b56f6c1-3f9e-4e15-8d66-55caf051b006",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "ShowHelp",
            "label": "Guidance / runtime investigation",
            "type": 10,
            "isRequired": true,
            "jsonData": "[{\"value\":\"On\",\"label\":\"On\"},{\"value\":\"Off\",\"label\":\"Off\"}]",
            "value": "Off"
          }
        ],
        "style": "pills"
      },
      "name": "Parameters"
    },
    {
      "type": 11,
      "content": {
        "version": "LinkItem/1.0",
        "style": "tabs",
        "links": [
          {
            "id": "4b56f6c1-3f9e-4e15-8d66-55caf051b101",
            "cellValue": "Environment",
            "linkTarget": "parameter",
            "linkLabel": "Organization overview",
            "subTarget": "All",
            "style": "link"
          },
          {
            "id": "24ecf7d5-388a-4dd1-be0b-1655d136e33f",
            "cellValue": "Environment",
            "linkTarget": "parameter",
            "linkLabel": "Azure",
            "subTarget": "Azure",
            "style": "link"
          },
          {
            "id": "b5d47c8e-db2f-4379-9db9-692f1323117a",
            "cellValue": "Environment",
            "linkTarget": "parameter",
            "linkLabel": "AWS",
            "subTarget": "AWS",
            "style": "link"
          },
          {
            "id": "4b56f6c1-3f9e-4e15-8d66-55caf051b104",
            "cellValue": "Environment",
            "linkTarget": "parameter",
            "linkLabel": "GCP",
            "subTarget": "GCP",
            "style": "link"
          },
          {
            "id": "4b56f6c1-3f9e-4e15-8d66-55caf051b105",
            "cellValue": "Environment",
            "linkTarget": "parameter",
            "linkLabel": "Hybrid / Arc",
            "subTarget": "Hybrid",
            "style": "link"
          },
          {
            "id": "4b56f6c1-3f9e-4e15-8d66-55caf051b106",
            "cellValue": "Environment",
